  "text": "Transport clear of the caldera. Core temperature rising. Geothermal containment has failed. The reservoirs have burst. Steam is pouring through the flues. The river is finding its bed again. The reservoirs have burst. Steam is pouring through the flues. The river is finding its bed again. Listen to the sky. That hum is breaking apart. The field that held us under glass is coming down. The emitters along sector four are arcing. There, the shield lattice is splitting. Confirmed on civilian channels. The sky shield over Neo Kyoto has collapsed. Their iron dome is gone. Ten years under a false twilight. Ten years of looking up at a shield we could never touch. No more. Their low altitude cover is gone. Stratus Docks is exposed. We have our way into the spire. Regroup at the rim and rearm. We are taking the high docks. Axiom force, prepare for insertion.",
